{
  "id": "JOS.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "JOS",
  "reference": "Joshua 11",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the news of Israel's victories reached King Jabin of Hazor, he sent word to King Jobab of Madon, to the kings of Shimron and Achshaph, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to the kings in the hill country in the north, in the Jordan Valley south of Lake Galilee, in the foothills, and on the coast near Dor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also sent word to the Canaanites on both sides of the Jordan, to the Amorites, the Hittites, the Perizzites, and the Jebusites in the hill country, as well as to the Hivites who lived at the foot of Mount Hermon in the land of Mizpah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They came with all their soldiers — an army with as many men as there are grains of sand on the seashore. They also had many horses and chariots. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these kings joined forces and came together and set up camp at Merom Brook to fight against Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Joshua, “Do not be afraid of them. By this time tomorrow I will have killed all of them for Israel. You are to cripple their horses and burn their chariots.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Joshua and all his men attacked them by surprise at Merom Brook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave the Israelites victory over them; the Israelites attacked and pursued them as far north as Misrephoth Maim and Sidon, and as far east as the valley of Mizpah. The fight continued until none of the enemy was left alive. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua did to them what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded: he crippled their horses and burnt their chariots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua then turned back, captured Hazor and killed its king. (At that time Hazor was the most powerful of all those kingdoms.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They put everyone there to death; no one was left alive, and the city was burnt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua captured all these cities and their kings, putting everyone to death, just as Moses, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s servant, had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "However, the Israelites did not burn any of the cities built on mounds, except Hazor, which Joshua did burn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel took all the valuables and livestock from these cities and kept them for themselves. But they put every person to death; no one was left alive. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had given his commands to his servant Moses, Moses had given them to Joshua, and Joshua obeyed them. He did everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua captured all the land — the hill country and foothills, both north and south, all the area of Goshen and the dry country south of it, as well as the Jordan Valley. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The territory extended from Mount Halak in the south near Edom, as far as Baalgad in the north, in the valley of Lebanon south of Mount Hermon. Joshua was at war with the kings of this territory for a long time, but he captured them all and put them to death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17+JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17",
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The only city that made peace with the people of Israel was Gibeon, where some of the Hivites lived. All the others were conquered in battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 7.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had made them determined to fight the Israelites, so that they would be condemned to total destruction and all be killed without mercy. This was what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this time Joshua went and destroyed the race of giants called the Anakim who lived in the hill country — in Hebron, Debir, Anab, and in all the hill country of Judah and Israel. Joshua completely destroyed them and their cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None of the Anakim were left in the land of Israel; a few, however, were left in Gaza, Gath, and Ashdod.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua captured the whole land, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. Joshua gave it to the Israelites as their own and divided it into portions, one for each tribe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the people rested from war.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JOS.12",
